# Internal working material, not published with the project: architecture notes,
# the recut of the backend contract, the divergence lists, the v0 mockups and
# the v0 export. All of it exists to build this frontend, none of it belongs in
# the remote repository. Only README.md is versioned.
*.md
# Only the one at the root: the pattern above is anchored nowhere, so an
# unanchored exception would also bring back docs/README.md.
!/README.md

docs/mockups/
docs/v0-reference/
